{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.545, "data": {"request_id": "2892518e2674", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:19.457Z", "t_ms": 6544, "delta": " API linearization:** API calls and their results are formatted as text sequences using special tokens, such as `e(c) = <API> a"}}
