{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.245, "data": {"request_id": "2892518e2674", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:20.157Z", "t_ms": 7243, "delta": "* **Sampling candidate calls:** For a given dataset of plain text, the model uses in-context prompts to propose candidate"}}
